# Operator: replace this placeholder with the project's real minisign
# public key. Generate the keypair once with:
#
#   minisign -G -p packaging/minisign.pub -s ~/.minisign/spt.key
#
# Commit packaging/minisign.pub. Keep ~/.minisign/spt.key OFF this repo;
# provision it to CI as the MINISIGN_SECRET_KEY secret (the secret-key
# file's full contents, not its path). Optional MINISIGN_PASSWORD secret
# unlocks an encrypted secret key in CI.
#
# Until that is done, scripts/sign/minisign-all.sh logs a warn and skips,
# so CI keeps producing unsigned artifacts plus checksums.
